File: src/fit_mesg.cpp
Function: Mesg::HasField
One decode of the test corpus takes about 358.833 ms.
The code below currently runs at 0.999485 of the original SDK's decode time; the best found so far is 0.999485.

Rewrite this function to make decoding faster:
```cpp
FIT_BOOL Mesg::HasField(const int fieldNum) const
{
    for (int i = 0; i < (int)fields.size(); i++)
    {
        if (fields[i].GetNum() == fieldNum)
            return FIT_TRUE;
    }

    return FIT_FALSE;
}
